  "description": "A small object-storage client for Rask: ranged reads, streaming writes, conditional create, prefix listing and delete, over Amazon S3 (and every S3-compatible store — Cloudflare R2, Google Cloud Storage via its S3 interop keys, MinIO, Backblaze B2, DigitalOcean Spaces) or Azure Blob Storage. Signs SigV4 itself and takes an Azure SAS as-is, so there is no cloud SDK to pull in. Runs server-side and in the browser under WebAssembly — the same client can upload a database snapshot from a host or sync a static site straight to a bucket with no backend. No external dependencies beyond Microsoft.Extensions.*.",
